"""
## Purpose and audience
Purpose: Verify `case` is a soft keyword, not a reserved word.
Audience: compiler and tooling engineers who maintain this spec.
## Operator workflow
Run this spec with the test runner and read the per-scenario verdict lines;
a failing scenario pinpoints the behavior that regressed.
## Compatibility and limitations
Covers the pinned behavior only; fixture data is local to this spec.
Troubleshooting: a red scenario here means the pinned contract changed —
check verification guidance in the linked design docs before editing oracles.
# @manual: primary
REQ-GEN-COMPILER-001
doc/01_research/local/REQ-GEN-COMPILER-001.md
doc/03_plan/sys_test/REQ-GEN-COMPILER-001.md
doc/04_architecture/REQ-GEN-COMPILER-001.md
doc/05_design/REQ-GEN-COMPILER-001.md
